          "logprobs": [],
          "text": "```java\npublic void testSymbolTableExpansionBytes() throws Exception {\n    final com.fasterxml.jackson.core.JsonFactory factory =\n            new com.fasterxml.jackson.core.JsonFactory();\n    final java.util.Random random = new java.util.Random(216L);\n\n    // Reuse the factory so parsers also exercise the shared symbol table.\n    for (int round = 0; round < 30; ++round) {\n        final int fieldCount = 400;\n        final String[] names = new String[fieldCount];\n        final java.io.ByteArrayOutputStream output =\n                new java.io.ByteArrayOutputStream();\n\n        try (com.fasterxml.jackson.core.JsonGenerator generator =\n                     factory.createGenerator(output)) {\n            generator.writeStartObject();\n            for (int i = 0; i < fieldCount; ++i) {\n                // Names longer than 12 UTF-8 bytes exercise long-name storage\n                // while unique names force symbol-table expansion.\n                names[i] = \"long_symbol_table_field_\" + round + \"_\" + i + \"_\"\n                        + Long.toHexString(random.nextLong());\n                generator.writeNumberField(names[i], i);\n            }\n            generator.writeEndObject();\n        }\n\n        // A byte-array parser uses ByteQuadsCanonicalizer, where the\n        // reported ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException occurred.\n        try (com.fasterxml.jackson.core.JsonParser parser =\n                     factory.createParser(output.toByteArray())) {\n            assertEquals(com.fasterxml.jackson.core.JsonToken.START_OBJECT,\n                    parser.nextToken());\n\n            for (int i = 0; i < fieldCount; ++i) {\n                assertEquals(names[i], parser.nextFieldName());\n                assertEquals(com.fasterxml.jackson.core.JsonToken.VALUE_NUMBER_INT,\n                        parser.nextToken());\n                assertEquals(i, parser.getIntValue());\n            }\n\n            assertEquals(com.fasterxml.jackson.core.JsonToken.END_OBJECT,\n                    parser.nextToken());\n            assertNull(parser.nextToken());\n        }\n    }\n}\n```"
        }
